1
00:00:00,576 --> 00:00:03,082
As Uke comes to grab both shoulders from behind

2
00:00:03,083 --> 00:00:04,144
draw him towards you

3
00:00:04,145 --> 00:00:05,870
As he comes round for the opposite shoulder

4
00:00:05,871 --> 00:00:08,461
take a big step forward and cut down.

5
00:00:09,062 --> 00:00:11,305
Switch and control his opposite wrist,

6
00:00:11,306 --> 00:00:13,992
take a half step to his rear
and draw him towards you

7
00:00:14,727 --> 00:00:16,554
as you place him down in front of you

8
00:00:16,555 --> 00:00:18,624
place his shoulder in between your knees

9
00:00:18,625 --> 00:00:19,678
switching the grip

10
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:21,564
placing his wrist against your shoulder,

11
00:00:21,565 --> 00:00:22,924
hug him in towards your body

12
00:00:22,925 --> 00:00:25,178
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

